some minor changes suggested for nethack 3.0:

the default pickup be off. historically from rogue it was default on but
things have changed considerably since then (i.e. many more useless items).

the default time mode be on since a sense of time is an essential strategy.

the default number of players in the record file be 99 not 100 for
aesthetic reasons ...

